  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0:\n\t\t\t- Added upload buttons in captions (above gutters) for left/right panels.\n\t\t\t- Display File Names in captions.\n\t\t\t- Display “Last Modified” dates right-justified in captions.\n\t\t\t- Clear buttons to reset panels.\n\t\t\t- Caption layout and styles refined; minor UI polish.\n\t\t\t1.1.0:\n\t\t\t- Added collapsible unchanged regions with ellipsis rows; click-to-expand.\n\t\t\t- Gutter click collapses contiguous unchanged sections.\n\t\t\t- Right-click context menu in text areas: Expand all collapsed / Collapse all expanded (context-aware).\n\t\t\t- Search: case-sensitive toggle, improved scroll-into-view behavior.\n\t\t\t- Unified font family/size across gutter and content via CSS variables.\n\t\t\t- Fixed minor issues with line number alignment and scroll sync.",
